   "text": "Guardrails / hard rules (GUARDRAILS.md, enforced)\n✅ rule book parsed + checked before every write\n✅ Review cards: album-first, offer-term check\n✅ Postgres ledger: 1 accept/tick, duels first\n🟡 Prompt injection: text is quoted data, markup\n    escaped; ⬜ no hard ≤200k cap yet\n🟡 Timeout per offer: tick budget + Jev 3 s;\n    ⬜ '10 s per offer, then learn' (learner)",
   "originalText": "Guardrails / hard rules (GUARDRAILS.md, enforced)\n✅ rule book parsed + checked before every write\n✅ Review cards: album-first, offer-term check\n✅ Postgres ledger: 1 accept/tick, duels first\n🟡 Prompt injection: text is quoted data, markup\n    escaped; ⬜ no hard ≤200k cap yet\n🟡 Timeout per offer: tick budget + Jev 3 s;\n    ⬜ '10 s per offer, then learn' (learner)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec10",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
